From 27ba7d638f800006827e4ce965bb509f0c3e475f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MediaGuard <mediaguard@localhost>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] MediaGuard: pre-grab download decision specification

New IDownloadDecisionEngineSpecification evaluated in a new, last
SpecificationPriority.PolicyHook group, so it only runs for releases
every upstream specification accepted (RSS, automatic and interactive
search). Rejections read 'MediaGuard: <message> [<reason_code>]' and are
visible in interactive search results. MEDIAGUARD_SHADOW_MODE=1 rejects
all grabs locally without a network call.
